    \ for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 319.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 319 | 1 | Harmony Integration on PCA Embedding | Veritas I | 184 | 0.6499 | 0.761 | 0.699 | 0.236 | 0.291 | 0.914 | 0.724 | 0.626 | 0.985 | 0.328 | 0.936 |\n| 313 | 1 | Manual Batch-Aware kNN (v2 - Optimized) | Veritas I | 182 | 0.6189 | 0.586 | 0.660 | 0.222 | 0.360 | 0.875 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.024 | 0.788 |\n| 306 | 1 | Manual Batch-Aware kNN on PCA-Combat Embedding | Veritas I | 180 | n.a.\
