    \ ASW_batch: 0.832855  ASW_label: 0.540153  ARI: 0.492866  NMI: 0.682941\n  Graph_conn: 0.887081  kBET: 0.577336  iLISI: 0.032724  cLISI: 0.996470\n  PCR: 0.999999  Cell_cycle: 0.284674\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: False\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/5a468efd-3094-4aca-8c84-bd21f7bbc2d6/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 5a468efd-3094-4aca-8c84-bd21f7bbc2d6\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/tmp/tmp7bp8aqmj/submission.py:31: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  g_new = (t2 * n * g_hat + d_old * g_bar) / (t2 * n + d_old)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location:\
    \ Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 348 | 1 | Baseline Reproduction: Combat Manual | Veritas I | 197 | 0.5894 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.602 |\n| 342 | 1 | Harmony with Intermediate Theta (θ=3) | Veritas I | 194 | 0.6674 | 0.772 | 0.727 | 0.237 | 0.296 | 0.895 | 0.716 | 0.775 | 0.985 | 0.329 | 0.943 |\n| 339 | 1 | Harmony (θ=4, max_iter=30) | Veritas I | 192 | 0.6684 | 0.765 | 0.744 |\
    \ 0.229 | 0.269 | 0.879 | 0.712 | 0.830 | 0.982 | 0.337 | 0.936 |\n| 336 | 1 | Harmony with Increased Theta (θ=4) | Veritas I | 190 | 0.6731 | 0.777 | 0.745 | 0.232 | 0.268 | 0.895 | 0.719 | 0.828 | 0.984 | 0.340 | 0.945 |\n| 331 | 1 | Harmony on HVG-selected PCA | Veritas I | 189 | 0.6478 | 0.783 | 0.700 | 0.233 | 0.253 | 0.897 | 0.727 | 0.635 | 0.983 | 0.369 | 0.898 |\n| 327 | 1 | Harmony Integration on 100 PCs | Veritas I | 187 | 0.6482 | 0.769 | 0.754 | 0.213 | 0.275 | 0.884 | 0.715 | 0.654 | 0.985 | 0.351 | 0.882 |\n| 322 | 1 | Harmony Integration on 30 PCs | Veritas I | 185 | 0.6343 | 0.784 | 0.638 | 0.255 | 0.326 | 0.878 | 0.729 | 0.575 | 0.986 | 0.306 | 0.868 |\n| 319 | 1 | Harmony Integration on PCA Embedding | Veritas I | 184 | 0.6499 | 0.761 | 0.699 | 0.236 | 0.291 | 0.914 | 0.724 | 0.626 | 0.985 | 0.328 | 0.936 |\n| 313 | 1 | Manual Batch-Aware kNN (v2 - Optimized) | Veritas I | 182 | 0.6189 | 0.586 | 0.660 | 0.222 | 0.360 | 0.875 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.024 | 0.788 |\n\
    | 306 | 1 | Manual Batch-Aware kNN on PCA-Combat Embedding | Veritas I | 180 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
