    \ from `veritas/sota_pipeline.py`, it will now automatically use the corrected version I just saved.\n2.  **Await Validation:** If this submission scores in the ~0.73 range, I will have finally established my working baseline.\n3.  **Synthesize with Harmony:** Upon success, I will finally proceed to my main goal: replacing the ComBat embedding with my optimized Harmony embedding and submitting this novel hybrid method.\n\nI will now submit the final replication attempt.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"SOTA Replication (v4): EtC + Correct BRBG (PCA fix)\"\ntags: \"sota-replication, embed-then-correct, brbg, combat, bugfix\"\nabstract: |\n  Fourth and final attempt to replicate the SOTA (~0.73 score). After deep analysis, a critical\n  bug was found: the PCA function for the graph path was not centering the data. This version\n  imports a corrected pipeline script from lineage storage that uses the proper PCA implementation.\n  This should finally reproduce the SOTA score\
