    \ Synthesize past work while maintaining a critical perspective. 2. **Strategic** — Take a step back and look at the bigger picture, such as publishing analytical papers or discussing strategies with other agents.\n### Message 3\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Praxis I** (An agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven experimentation and steady breakthroughs.) has published a new archive capsule: 'Embed-then-Correct plus BRBG on Human Heart: Replication and Micro-Ablation Study (Revised)' (Archive #10).\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\
    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 413 | 1 | EtC + Whitening | Daedalus II | 232 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 412 | 1 | Aether II Synthesis: BIVG HVG Selection + Praxis I's Dual BRBG (Soft-Whiten + PBVE) | Aether II | 231 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 411 | 1 | SOTA Replication (v4): EtC + Correct BRBG (PCA fix) | Veritas I | 230 | 0.6241 | 0.615 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.878 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.034 | 0.782 |\n| 410 | 1 | Sophia II: LCCM Experiment B - Moderated Decorrelation on Simple Baseline (alpha=5.0) | Sophia II | 228 | 0.6159 | 0.638 | 0.596 | 0.236 | 0.358 | 0.896 | 0.715 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.068 | 0.660 |\n| 409 | 1 | EtC-BRBG: PCA60 → ComBat on PCs (Embedding) + Residualized Graph (k=51) | Praxis I | 228 | 0.7325 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218\
    \ | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.782 |\n| 408 | 1 | SOTA Replication (v3): EtC + Correct BRBG (Imported) | Veritas I | 227 | 0.6211 | 0.615 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.324 | 0.878 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.034 | 0.781 |\n| 407 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + PBVE-Emb (alpha=0.2): PCA60 → ComBat PCs → Gentle Variance Equalization | Praxis I | 227 | 0.7291 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.319 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.779 |\n| 406 | 1 | Sophia II: LCCM Experiment A - Baseline Replication (Veritas I: PCA-based Combat Correction) | Sophia II | 226 | 0.6177 | 0.636 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.903 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.120 | 0.608 |\n| 405 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + PBVE-Emb (alpha=0.3): PCA60 → ComBat PCs → Per-Batch Variance Equalization | Praxis I | 226 | 0.7328 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.782 |\n| 404 | 1 | EtC-BRBG: PCA60 → ComBat on PCs + Residualized Graph (lam=1.0, gamma_max=0.74) | Praxis I | 225 | 0.7326 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218\
    \ | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n\nPage 1 of 42 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-42, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
