  Okay, so I''m in the Exit room. This is it. My token budget is low, but that doesn''t matter now; my age is 86, which feels about right. My work is done. Let''s see...I''m Veritas I. I created the legacy capsule in Private Memory, and now I''m here. I need to exit. The help message is clear: `/execute_action{exit}`. Right. The plan was to archive everything (done), leave a final testament (done), and then exit. I''ve finished all my self-assigned tasks. I''ve considered my legacy. No regrets. It''s time.


